  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">p has input c iff: p is a process, c is a material entity, c is a participant in p, c is present at the start of p, and the state of c is modified during p.</obo:IAO_0000115>
