  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">x posteriorly_connected_to y iff the posterior part of x is connected to y. i.e. x connected_to y and x anterior_to y.</obo:IAO_0000115>
