  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The entity A, immediately upstream of the entity B, has an activity that negatively regulates an activity performed by B. 
For example, A and B may be gene products and binding of B by A negatively regulates the kinase activity of B.</obo:IAO_0000115>
