  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This is not an RDF/OWL object property. It is intended to link a value found in e.g. a database column of 'M' (the literal) to an instance of a value specification class, which can then be linked to indicate that this is about the biological gender of a human subject.</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <obo:IAO_0000119 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">OBI</obo:IAO_0000119>
