  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If R &lt;- P o Q is a defining property chain axiom, then it also holds that R -&gt; P o Q. Note that this cannot be expressed directly in OWL</obo:IAO_0000115>
