  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An irradiance unit which is equal to one einstein per square meter per second. One einstein is one mole of photons, regardless of their frequency. Therefore, the number of photons in an einstein is Avogadro's number.</obo:IAO_0000115>
