  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A bone that is shaped as a broad flat plate and composed of two thin layers of compact tissue enclosing between them a variable quantity of cancellous tissue, which is the location of red bone marrow.</obo:IAO_0000115>
