  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The sclera and cornea form the fibrous tunic of the bulb of the eye; the sclera is opaque, and constitutes the posterior five-sixths of the tunic; the cornea is transparent, and forms the anterior sixth.</obo:IAO_0000115>
