  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process that gives rise to the medulla oblongata. This process pertains to the initial formation of a structure from unspecified parts. The medulla oblongata lies directly above the spinal cord and controls vital autonomic functions such as digestion, breathing and the control of heart rate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  <oboI:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">biological_process</oboI:hasOBONamespace>
