  <oboI:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UBERON:0002342</oboI:id>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gene notes: Many factors and genes, such as Pax3 (Tremblay et al., 1995), slug (Nieto et al., 1994), AP-2 (Zhang et al., 1996; Schorle et al., 1996), and Wnt-1/3a (Ikeya et al., 1997) are expressed in the dorsal most region of the neural tube, and have been shown to be involved in the generation of neural crest cells.</rdfs:comment>
