  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A cellular localization process whereby a substance or cellular entity, such as a protein complex or organelle, is transported to, and/or maintained in, a specific location within a cell including the localization of substances or cellular entities to the cell membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
