  <term:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199"/>
  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An infection that is caused by a bacterium that would generally not be able to cause an infection in a host with a normal immune system. Such bacteria take advantage of the opportunity, so to speak, that is provided by a weakened immune system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
