  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any substance that causes disturbance to organisms by chemical reaction or other activity on the molecular scale, when a sufficient quantity is absorbed by the organism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
