  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Note that this term does not have a 'developmental process' parent because ossification isn't necessarily developmental, can also occur as part of bone remodeling. Instead use 'ossification involved in bone maturation ; GO:0043931'.</rdfs:comment>
