  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Skeletogenic cell that has the potential to develop into a chondroblast; and arises from neural crest, meseosdermal and notochordal and connective tissue cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
