  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The developmental process in which a ventricular septum is generated and organized. A ventricular septum is an anatomical structure that separates the lower chambers (ventricles) of the heart from one another.</obo:IAO_0000115>
