  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The orderly movement of a cell from one site to another that will contribute to the progression of the heart over time, from its initial formation, to the mature organ.</obo:IAO_0000115>
