  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An example of this is MMRN2 in human (Q9H8L6) in PMID:25745997 (inferred from direct assay).</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">negative regulation of epithelial tube formation</rdfs:label>
