  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This term should only be used when it is not possible to determine which phase or subtype of the apoptotic process is regulated by a gene product. Whenever detailed information is available, the more granular children terms should be used.</rdfs:comment>
