  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any process in which a cell, a substance, or a cellular entity, such as a protein complex or organelle, is transported, tethered to or otherwise maintained in a specific location. In the case of substances, localization may also be achieved via selective degradation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
