  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A process that is carried out at the cellular level which results in the assembly, arrangement of constituent parts, or disassembly of the basement membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
