  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process in which a cellular entity is generated and organized. A cellular entity has granularity above the level of a protein complex but below that of an anatomical system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
