  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The progression of the cardiac skeleton over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The cardiac skeleton is a specialized extracellular matrix that separates the atria from the ventricles and provides physical support for the heart.</obo:IAO_0000115>
