  <oboI:hasExactSynonym rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">nerve cell</oboI:hasExactSynonym>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">These cells are also reportedly CD4-negative and CD200-positive. They are also capable of producing CD40L and IFN-gamma.</rdfs:comment>
