  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any process that activates or increases the frequency, rate or extent of the process involved in the formation, arrangement of constituent parts, or disassembly of cell projections.</obo:IAO_0000115>
