  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The multiplication or reproduction of cardiac muscle myoblasts, resulting in the expansion of a cardiac muscle myoblast cell population. A cardiac myoblast is a precursor cell that has been committed to a cardiac muscle cell fate but retains the ability to divide and proliferate throughout life.</obo:IAO_0000115>
