  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A transverse unitary subdivision of the neural tube that shares a common dorsoventral structure (floor, basal, alar, and roof plates), but each having differential molecular identities and fates; they comprise the secondary prosencephalon, diencephalon (prosomeres), the midbrain (mesomeres), and the hindbrain (rhombomeres).</obo:IAO_0000115>
