  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Increased susceptibility to bacterial infections as manifested by recurrent or severe/invasive bacterial infection, or by bacterial infection in an unusual anatomical location.</obo:IAO_0000115>
