  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A process in which a monoatomic ion is transported across a membrane. Monatomic ions (also called simple ions) are ions consisting of exactly one atom.</obo:IAO_0000115>
