  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The directed movement of carbohydrate into, out of or within a cell, or between cells, by means of some agent such as a transporter or pore. Carbohydrates are a group of organic compounds based of the general formula Cx(H2O)y.</obo:IAO_0000115>
