  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The multiplication or reproduction of cells, resulting in the expansion of a mesenchymal cell population. A mesenchymal cell is a cell that normally gives rise to other cells that are organized as three-dimensional masses, rather than sheets.</obo:IAO_0000115>
