  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any organonitrogen compound containing a carbamimidamido (guanidino) group. Guanidines have the general structure (R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;N)(R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;4&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;N)C=N-R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;5&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; and are related structurally to amidines and ureas.</obo:IAO_0000115>
