  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The multiplication or reproduction of stem cells, resulting in the expansion of a stem cell population. A stem cell is a cell that retains the ability to divide and proliferate throughout life to provide progenitor cells that can differentiate into specialized cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
