  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The developmental process pertaining to the initial formation of a cardiac atrium from unspecified parts. A cardiac atrium receives blood from a vein and pumps it to a cardiac ventricle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
