  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process that gives rise to the hindbrain. This process pertains to the initial formation of a structure from unspecified parts. The hindbrain is the region consisting of the medulla, pons and cerebellum. Areas of the hindbrain control motor and autonomic functions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  <oboI:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">biological_process</oboI:hasOBONamespace>
