  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The epithelial cell differentiation process in which a relatively unspecialized cell acquires specialized features of an acinar cell, a secretory cell that is grouped together with other cells of the same type to form grape-shaped clusters known as acini.</obo:IAO_0000115>
