  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any process that increases the rate, frequency, or extent of the progression of the sclerotome over time, from its initial formation to the mature structure. The sclerotome is the portion of the somite that will give rise to a vertebra.</obo:IAO_0000115>
