  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The myofibril assembly process that results in the organization of muscle actomyosin into sarcomeres. The sarcomere is the repeating unit of a myofibril in a muscle cell, composed of an array of overlapping thick and thin filaments between two adjacent Z discs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
