  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A specialized epithelial cell involved in sensory perception. Restricted to special sense organs of the olfactory, gustatory, and vestibulocochlear receptor systems; contain sensory cells surrounded by supportive, non-receptive cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
