  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A collagen heterotrimer containing type IV alpha chains; [alpha1(IV)]2alpha2(IV) trimers are commonly observed, although more type IV alpha chains exist and may be present in type IV trimers; type IV collagen triple helices associate to form 3 dimensional nets within basement membranes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  <oboI:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Wikipedia:Collagen_type_IV</oboI:hasDbXref>
