  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A mitotic cell cycle process which results in the assembly, arrangement, or disassembly of the nuclear inner or outer membrane during mitosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
