  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The regionalization process that specifies animal organ primordium boundaries resulting in a restriction of organogenesis to a limited spatial domain and keeping the organ separate from surrounding tissues.</obo:IAO_0000115>
