  <x_1.1:description xml:lang="en">This entity models a process in disease A's course that produces a disorder which becomes part of disease B — the complication. The disorder as output is not the disorder of the producing disease but a newly instantiated structural abnormality that grounds a secondary disease.</x_1.1:description>
