  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Synovial sac which surrounds parts of one or more tendons. Examples: synovial tendon sheath of manual digit 2, radial bursa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
