  <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the digestive tract over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The digestive tract is the anatomical structure through which food passes and is processed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
