  <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A clinical tumor stage group according to AJCC 7th edition indicating cancers with increasing tumor or nodal extent greater than in Stage II and with differing characteristics from IIIA and IIIB.</obo:IAO_0000115>
