  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the muscle over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The muscle is an organ consisting of a tissue made up of various elongated cells that are specialized to contract and thus to produce movement and mechanical work.</owl:annotatedTarget>
