  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process aimed at the progression of a cardiac neural crest cell over time, from initial commitment of the cell to its specific fate, to the fully functional differentiated cell that contributes to the development of the heart.</owl:annotatedTarget>
