  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The progression of a skeletal muscle organ over time from its initial formation to its mature state. A skeletal muscle organ includes the skeletal muscle tissue and its associated connective tissue.</owl:annotatedTarget>
