  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The directed movement of lipids into, out of or within a cell, or between cells, by means of some agent such as a transporter or pore. Lipids are compounds soluble in an organic solvent but not, or sparingly, in an aqueous solvent.</owl:annotatedTarget>
