  <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A disease of metabolism that has_material_basis_in enzyme deficiency or accumulation of enzymes or toxins which interfere with normal function due to an endocrine organ disease, organ malfunction, inadequate intake, dietary deficiency, or malabsorption.</owl:annotatedTarget>
