  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The basic cellular unit of nervous tissue. Each neuron consists of a body, an axon, and dendrites. Their purpose is to receive, conduct, and transmit impulses in the nervous system.</owl:annotatedTarget>
