  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Single-cell transcriptomics of murine aorta identifies two adventitial fibroblast-specific markers, PDGFRA and DPEP1, which were validated at the protein level by immunohistochemistry and flow cytometry across human and murine arteries, highlighting fibroblast heterogeneity in health and cardiovascular disease (CVD) in humans and mice.</owl:annotatedTarget>
