  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any process that mediates interactions between a cell and its surroundings that contributes to the process of cardiac conduction. Encompasses interactions such as signaling or attachment between one cell and another cell, between a cell and an extracellular matrix, or between a cell and any other aspect of its environment.</owl:annotatedTarget>
