  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process in which a chondroblast acquires specialized structural and/or functional features of a chondrocyte that will contribute to the development of a bone. A chondrocyte is a polymorphic cell that forms cartilage.</owl:annotatedTarget>
