  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The regrowth of a lost or destroyed body part, such as an organ or tissue. This process may occur via renewal, repair, and/or growth alone (i.e. increase in size or mass).</owl:annotatedTarget>
