  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process in which the anatomical structures of blood vessels of the heart are generated and organized. The blood vessel is the vasculature carrying blood.</owl:annotatedTarget>
