  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process whose specific outcome is the progression of a striated muscle cell over time, from its formation to the mature structure. Striated muscle cells contain fibers that are divided by transverse bands into striations, and cardiac and skeletal muscle are types of striated muscle.</owl:annotatedTarget>
