  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A cytoplasmic, membrane bound vesicle that is capable of fusing to the plasma membrane to release its contents into the extracellular space.</owl:annotatedTarget>
