  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An organism subdivision that includes the pectoral girdle skeleton and associated soft tissue. Note that this includes both the skeletal elements and associated tissues (integument, muscle, etc). Examples: There are only two instances in an organism, right and left pectoral girdle regions.</owl:annotatedTarget>
