  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the heart over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The heart is a hollow, muscular organ, which, by contracting rhythmically, keeps up the circulation of the blood.</owl:annotatedTarget>
