  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">q1 different_in_magnitude_relative_to q2 if and only if magnitude(q1) NOT =~ magnitude(q2). Here, magnitude(q) is a function that maps a quality to a unit-invariant scale.</owl:annotatedTarget>
